<title>SWEDEN: Swedish March unemployment 8.0 pct - labour board.</title>
<headline>Swedish March unemployment 8.0 pct - labour board.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish unemployment fell to eight percent in March, from 8.4 percent in February, the country's Labour Market Board (Ams) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Total unemployment, including people in government work schemes fell to 13.1 percent in March from 13.4 percent in February.</p>
<p> SWEDISH UNEMPLOYMENT	 March 97    Feb 97     March 96</p>
<p> Percent of workforce	 8.0	   8.4	  7.3</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	 339,000     355,000    309,000</p>
<p>Note - Statistics Sweden will release unemployment figures on April 11.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
